		Label: Focus Command
		Desc: Auto recovery, manual activation. Extends flight range from about 2.5 to 2.9 visible screen widths, increases ATK by 10%-30%, reduces attack interval by 20%-50%, and chains between up to 5 targets only after a direct collision. Lasts 25-35 seconds
	}

	3: {
		Label: Glorious Shards
		Desc: Auto recovery, manual activation. Places a stationary 4-second storm with a 16-tile radius at the visible enemy with the highest current HP within 25 tiles of the cursor. Every 0.5 seconds, drops a 100%-150% damage bolt onto a random enemy inside, then chains between up to 4 targets within the storm. Stores 2 charges; one cast per key press. Storms vanish when the weapon is put away
	}
