	}
}

UtageKatana: {
	1: {
		Label: Distracted
		Desc: Auto recovery, manual activation. Stops attacking for 8 seconds, grants 10-19 defense and restores 1%-2% maximum life each second. Switching weapon or skill ends the effect; both skills share a minimum cooldown that switching cannot reset
	}

	2: {
		Label: Descending Strike - Earth Splitter
		Desc: Auto recovery, manual activation. Consumes 50% current life, leaving at least 1; grants 50%-110% ATK and converts slashes to Arts that ignore defense but respect Arts resistance for 13-16 seconds. Switching weapon or skill ends the effect; both skills share a minimum cooldown
	}
}

RedDagger: {
	1: {
		Label: Execution Mode
		Desc: Switching to this weapon from another hotbar weapon, teleporting, starting a dash or landing at high speed releases a 100% ATK physical burst within 7 tiles. Grants 50% attack speed, 35%-80% ATK and 10%-20% dodge against NPC/projectile damage for 5 seconds. Shared cooldown starts on activation and lasts 5 seconds; another weapon switch or movement event is required when ready. Speed does not stack indefinitely. Bonuses apply only while holding the dagger
	}

	2: {
		Label: Wolfpack
		Desc: Switching to this weapon from another hotbar weapon, teleporting, starting a dash or landing at high speed releases a 140%-250% ATK physical burst within 7 tiles, stuns ordinary enemies for 1-3 seconds and grants 50% attack speed for 5 seconds. Cannot hit through walls; bosses and segmented enemies cannot be stunned. Shared 5-second cooldown starts on activation and cannot be reset by switching. Bonuses apply only while holding the dagger
	}
}

HoolheyakWindArts: {
	1: {
		Label: The Pursuit of Knowledge
		Desc: Charges automatically and triggers on attack. Fires empowered wind bolts at up to 2 distinct nearby enemies for 160%-300% damage; a lone target is lifted for 2-4 seconds. Stores 1-3 charges. No charge is spent without a target
	}

	2: {
		Label: Astral Alignment
		Desc: Activate for 16 seconds. Cast nine-shot volleys at random nearby enemies, each dealing 20%-45% damage with an 8%-15% chance to lift small enemies for 1 second. The final bolt of each volley can create or strengthen a vortex on impact
	}

	3: {
		Label: The Erudite's Delirium
		Desc: Activate for 45 seconds. Attack more slowly with three parallel cyclones that pierce unlimited enemies and retain 99% of their speed each frame. Damage increases with travel distance, reaching a maximum of 320%-420% after 30 tiles. Lifts small enemies for 1.6-2.2 seconds
	}
}

SussurroStaff: {
